Hint:\"角色配置和 RAM 权限映射会对新的权限判定立即生效；运行中工作继续使用已快照的运行上下文，直到重启。\",diffEmpty:\"没有角色变更。\",noAffectedMembers:\"当前没有已编入成员受影响。\"},backToTeams:\"← Teams\",notFound:\"team_not_found\",tabs:{overview:\"概览\",roles:\"Roles\",members:\"成员\",projects:\"关联项目\",memory:\"Team Memory\",settings:\"设置\"},membersRoles:\"{{members}} 名成员 · {{roles}} 个角色\",projectsCount:\"{{count}} 个项目\",createdAt:\"创建于 {{date}}\",memoryHeading:\"⌗ team-memory\",overview:{roleMix:\"角色定义\",roleMixHint:\"运行默认值\",roleSpec:\"{{cli}} · {{model}} · 每 Agent 最多 {{conc}} 个任务\",ramUsedBy:\"{{count}} 名成员使用\",noRamRoles:\"未映射 RAM Role\",summary:\"团队概况\",summaryHint:\"结构 + team-memory\",enrolledMembers:\"已编入成员\",declaredRoles:\"声明角色\",linkedProjects:\"关联项目\",teamMemory:\"team-memory\",memoryEntries:\"{{count}} entries\",runningTasks:\"运行中任务\",blockedTasks:\"阻塞任务\",healthNote:\"运行中 / 阻塞任务、成员在线状态为实时运行遥测，Phase-1 尚未接入 facade 聚合，接入后填真值（暂显 —）。\"},members:{title:\"Members\",addMember:\"+ Add member\",exclusivityNote:\"<b>独占规则：</b>agent 同一时刻只属于一个 team（add 时若已在别处 → 二次确认迁移）；human 可同时多 team。\",emptyTitle:\"还没有成员\",emptyBody:\"点 + Add member 把 agent / human 编入声明角色。\",colMember:\"成员\",colKind:\"类型\",colDeclaredRole:\"声明角色\",colCliModel:\"CLI / Model\",colCapabilities:\"能力\",colConcurrency:\"并发\",colPermissionSource:\"权限来源 / Scope\",sourceTeamRole:\"team_member → Team Role\",scopeTeam:\"scope team:{{teamId}}\",configureAccess:\"配置权限\",exclusiveTag:\"独占\",remove:\"Remove\",removeTitle:\"移除成员\",removeMessage:\"确认把 {{ref}} 移出本 team？\",removeConfirm:\"移除\"},projects:{title:\"关联项目\",associate:\"+ Associate project\",emptyTitle:\"未关联项目\",emptyBody:\"关联项目后，该 team 成员可被派发该项目任务。\",unlink:\"解绑\",note:\"关联项目后，该 team 成员可被派发该项目任务；team-memory 在项目上下文可见。\",unlinkTitle:\"解绑项目\",unlinkMessage:\"确认解绑该项目？成员将不再被派发其任务。\",unlinkConfirm:\"解绑\",pickerTitle:\"关联项目\",pickerSubtitle:\"从组织的项目里选一个关联到本 team；成员即可被派发该项目任务。\",associating:\"关联中…\",associateAction:\"关联\",selectLabel:\"选择项目\",selectPlaceholder:\"— 选择项目 —\",selectOption:\"{{name}}（{{id}}）\",pickerEmptyTitle:\"没有可关联的项目\",pickerEmptyBody:\"组织下的活跃项目都已关联，或还没有项目。\"},settings:{title:\"Team memory 设置\",manageHint:\"owner/admin 可写\",readOnlyHint:\"当前角色只读\",policy:\"审核策略\",policyOwnerAdmin:\"仅提案 - Owner/admin 审核\",policyCurator:\"Curator 审核 - 指定 Agent 可审核\",policyDescriptions:{owner_admin_review:\"Team 内 Agent 可以提交 memory proposal。只有 human owner/admin 能 promote 或 reject；审核通过前不会进入正式 team memory。\",curator_review:\"Team 内 Agent 可以提交 proposal。下方列出的 curator agent 也可以 promote 或 reject 待审 proposal；owner/admin 仍保留同样审核权限。\"},curators:\"Curator agents\",curatorsHelpActive:\"这些 agent 可以 promote 或 reject 待审 proposal。Agent 从 team 移除后，会自动失去 curator 权限。\",curatorsHelpInactive:\"选择 Curator 审核后，这份授权列表才会生效。仅提案模式下，只有 owner/admin 能审核。\",noAgents:\"目录中还没有 agent。\",save:\"Save\",saveSuccess:\"设置已保存。\",saveError:\"保存失败：{{message}}\",commit:\"settings commit {{commit}}\",noCommit:\"暂无 settings commit\",guardrails:\"约束\",agentSelfGrant:\"Agent 不能把自己授予 curator 权限。设置变更必须由 owner/admin 审核。\",reviewSurface:\"Promote 后的 memory 对新会话与新 fork 生效；运行中的会话继续使用已快照 rules。\"}},$C={title:\"New Team\",subtitle:\"声明角色配比 —— 每角色单独配 CLI / model / tags / 并发。创建即声明角色 slots 与 memory-repo（Phase-1 不铸 agent 身份，运行时另行编入）。\",footerHint:\"创建后 → 声明角色 slots + team-memory repo（agent 运行时编入）\",creating:\"创建中…\",submit:\"创建 Team\",nameLabel:\"Team name\",namePlaceholder:\"e.g. payments-squad\",visibilityLabel:\"可见性\",descriptionLabel:\"Description\",descriptionPlaceholder:\"这个编队负责什么…\",roleMixLabel:\"角色配比\",slotsSummary:\"Σ {{slots}} slots = 派生 {{slots}} 个 agent\",errRoleNameRequired:\"每个角色都需要填写角色名。\",errRoleNameDuplicate:\"角色名不能重复。\",assignmentsLabel:\"候选授权分配\",assignmentsCount:\"已选择 {{count}} 项\",assignmentSubjectPlaceholder:\"选择 subject\",assignmentAdd:\"添加分配\",assignmentsEmpty:\"选择 subject 和角色后预览授权变化。\",assignmentRiskHigh:\"{{count}} 项权限 · 高风险\",assignmentRiskLow:\"{{count}} 项权限 · 标准风险\"},FC={errIdentityNotFound:\"该 agent / human 不存在或已注销，请重新选择。\",errInvalidInput:\"成员标识不合法。\",errConflict:\"该 agent 已在另一个 team，请刷新后重试。\",errNotFound:\"来源信息